NAME: snippet demo: the bomber snippet behind (SPL 0) with step 3044: the stone
DESCRIPTION: includes snippets/bomber.src and compiles to the stone archetype's code (labels renamed); see behtests/snippet_stone.beh
SRC:
(program
  (include "snippets/bomber.src")
  (seq (SPL 0) (bomber 3044)))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  SPL    #0     , #0     
_REP8 
  ADD.AB #3044  , $_LET5 
  MOV.I  $_LET5 , @_LET5 
  JMP    $_REP8 , #0     
_LET5 
  DAT    #0     , #0     
  DAT    $0     , $0     